        "real_text": "<b>Forced Response</b>: After you resolve a mission attempt, place 1 attempt counter here and deal 1 damage to each ally at the mission. If there are 4 attempt counters here, remove Mission Team from the game and flip this card over.\n<b>When Defeated</b>: Shuffle each player card at the mission into its owner's deck. Flip Mission Team and this card over.",
