        "real_text": "Threat cannot be removed from this scheme by heroes or allies.\n<b>Alter-Ego Action</b>: Exhaust your identity → remove 1 threat from here. Any player may trigger this ability.\n<b>When Defeated</b>: The player who defeated this scheme searches their deck and discard pile for an [[Item]] card and puts it into play.",
